Feed the Swarm :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Night's Whisper :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Sign in Blood :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Chaos Warp :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion
Talisman of Indulgence :: premier support piece providing board presence, ramp, or recursion

# Game Changers and Interaction
